{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785175340807,"sessionID":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_lsmSxpc71CBNDMrQQ9LufdKM","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Research metadata census","prompt":"Execute exactly one deep-research iteration using the fully rendered prompt pack at `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/prompts/iteration-001.md`. Read that prompt first, then read its config, state log, and strategy before research. Obey its packet-only write boundary and output contract. Do not dispatch subagents. Return only the concise iteration completion report after verifying the three required artifacts.","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_05b457c6fffeF2PA48ooww8Xqm\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 1 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Exact 12-skill × eight-file root metadata census and producer evidence  \n**Findings**: 5 findings (5 new)  \n**newInfoRatio**: 1.00  \n**Questions answered**: Root-level census and producer classification  \n**Questions remaining**: 4  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success—`command-metadata.json` ownership remains provisional  \n**Recommended next focus**: Trace consumers and schemas for the four hub identity/router files\n\n**Files written**:\n- `research/lineages/sol-high-fast/iterations/iteration-001.md`\n- `research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-state.jsonl`\n- `research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deltas/iter-001.jsonl`\n\n**Verification**:\n- Three artifacts exist: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Delta canonical record matches state: yes\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","sessionId":"ses_05b457c6fffeF2PA48ooww8Xqm","model":{"modelID":"