scaffolds description, graph-metadata, mode-registry, and hub-router for parent hubs.\",\"evidence\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:528-553\"]}\n{\"type\":\"finding\",\"iteration\":1,\"id\":\"manifest-producer\",\"summary\":\"generate-leaf-manifest.cjs derives leaf-manifest from a hub registry or standalone config and optional authored aliases.\",\"evidence\":[\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-19\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:50-68\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:95-127\",\".opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:173-218\"]}\n{\"type\":\"observation\",\"iteration\":1,\"id\":\"command-metadata-provisional\",\"summary\":\"command-metadata exists only at sk-design and no producer was found in create-command or command trees; hand-authored classification remains provisional.\"}","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deltas/iter-001.jsonl","text":"{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":1,\"run\":1,\"mode\":\"research\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-research\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=research target_agent=deep-research\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"Build the exact 12-skill by eight-file root-level presence census and identify producer evidence for each file type.\",\"findingsCount\":5,\"newInfoRatio\":1.0,\"noveltyJustification\":\"All 5 findings were fully new in this first lineage iteration, including the exact census, totals, and producer classifications.\",\"keyQuestions\":[\"What is the complete 12-skill by eight-file root-level census, and who produces each file type?\"],\"answeredQuestions\":[\"What is the complete 12