enerated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it?\",\n108:       \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n109:       \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n110:       \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n111:       \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n112:       \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n113:       \"resolvedAtIteration\": null\n114:     }\n115:   ],\n116:   \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n117:     {\n118:       \"id\": \"question-1-what-is-the-complete-12-skill-by-eight-file-root-level-census-and-who-produces-e\",\n119:       \"inboxId\": null,\n120:       \"text\": \"What is the complete 12-skill by eight-file root-level census, and who produces each file type?\",\n121:       \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n122:       \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n123:       \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n124:       \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n125:       \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n126:       \"resolvedAtIteration\": 1\n127:     }\n128:   ],\n129:   \"carriedForwardOpenQuestions\": [\n130:     {\n131:       \"text\": \"What complete consumer and schema set governs each type?\",\n132:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n133:       \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n134:     },\n135:     {\n136:       \"text\": \"What behavior impact determines whether graph-only, alias, command, and sparse cases are required, optional, or defective?\",\n137:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n138:       \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n139:     },\n140:     {\n141:       \"text\": \"What class taxonomy explains every presence difference?\",\n142:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n143:       \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n144:     },\n145:     {\n146:       \"text\": \"Which consumer or history evidence conclusively owns `command-metadata.json`?\",\n147:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n148:       \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n149:     },\n150:     {\n151:       \"text\": \"Where should the canonical contract and fleet enforcement live?\",\n152:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n153:       \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n154:     }\n155:   ],\n156:   \"uncoveredQuestions\": [\n157:     \"What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\",\n158:     \"What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\",\n159:     \"How should the five graph-only skills, `leaf-aliases.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and sparse `sk-git` be classified after behavior-impact checks?\",\n160:     \"Where should the canonical contract live in `sk-doc/create-skill`, what can be generated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it?\"\n161:   ],\n162:   \"keyFindings\": [\n163:     {\n164:       \"id\": \"finding-1-5-command-metadata-json-is-a-singleton-confined-to-sk-design-its-two-entries-descr\",\n165:       \"text\": \"`command-metadata.json` is a singleton confined to `sk-design`; its two entries describe `/interface:design` and `/interface:design-reference`. No producer reference was found in `sk-doc/create-command` or `.opencode/commands`, so current evidence classifies it as hand-authored, not generated; this classification should remain provisional until consumer/schema research traces its ownership history. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-16] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:374-386] [INFERENCE: exact searches for `command-metadata` under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands` returned no matches]\",\n166:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n167:       \"sources\": [\n168:         \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n169:         \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n170:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n171:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n172:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n173:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n174:         \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n175:       ]\n176:     },\n177:     {\n178:       \"id\": \"finding-1-4-leaf-manifest-json-is-the-one-clearly-derived-artifact-generate-leaf-manifest-cj\",\n179:       \"text\": \"`leaf-manifest.json` is the one clearly derived artifact: `generate-leaf-manifest.cjs --write` builds it from `mode-registry.json` for hubs or from `leaf-manifest.config.json` for registry-less standalone skills, optionally incorporating authored `leaf-aliases.json` for hubs, and writes canonical bytes. The script explicitly calls aliases “authored,” while standalone config is an input declaration rather than generated output. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-19] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:50-68] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:95-127] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:173-218]\",\n180:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n181:       \"sources\": [\n182:         \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n183:         \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n184:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n185:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n186:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n187:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n188:         \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n189:       ]\n190:     },\n191:     {\n192:       \"id\": \"finding-1-2-fleet-totals-are-description-json-7-12-graph-metadata-json-12-12-leaf-manifest-j\",\n193:       \"text\": \"Fleet totals are: `description.json` 7/12, `graph-metadata.json` 12/12, `leaf-manifest.json` 11/12, `leaf-manifest.config.json` 4/12, `leaf-aliases.json` 5/12, `mode-registry.json` 7/12, `hub-router.json` 7/12, and `command-metadata.json` 1/12. Thus `graph-metadata.json` is the only universally present type; `sk-git` is the sole graph-only root. [INFERENCE: arithmetic over the exact matrix in Finding 1; the `sk-git` graph node is present at `.opencode/skills/sk-git/graph-metadata.json:1`]\",\n194:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n195:       \"sources\": [\n196:         \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n197:         \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n198:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n199:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n200:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n201:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n202:         \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n203:       ]\n204:     },\n205:     {\n206:       \"id\": \"finding-1-3-four-file-types-have-explicit-parent-hub-scaffold-producer-evidence-init-skill-p\",\n207:       \"text\": \"Four file types have explicit parent-hub scaffold producer evidence: `init_skill.py --kind parent` writes `mode-registry.json`, `hub-router.json`, `graph-metadata.json`, and `description.json` at the new hub root. These are scaffold outputs, though their checked-in values remain author-maintained after creation. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:528-553]\",\n208:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n209:       \"sources\": [\n210:         \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n211:         \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n212:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n213:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n214:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n215:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n216:         \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n217:       ]\n218:     },\n219:     {\n220:       \"id\": \"finding-1-1-the-exact-root-level-census-is-below-y-means-the-direct-child-file-exists-means-\",\n221:       \"text\": \"The exact root-level census is below. `Y` means the direct-child file exists; `—` means the exact direct-child glob returned no such file. Nested packet/mode metadata was excluded. [INFERENCE: exact direct-child inventory from `Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`, cross-checked against the 12 entries returned by reading `.opencode/skills/`]\",\n222:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n223:       \"sources\": [\n224:         \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n225:         \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n226:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n227:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n228:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n229:         \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n230:         \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n231:       ]\n232:     }\n233:   ],\n234:   \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n235:     {\n236:       \"id\": \"ruled-out-92c156ff35b9\",\n237:       \"text\": \"A broad `command-metadata.json` search produced oversized output; narrowing to the create-command and command trees found no producer. Future work should search its consumers and Git history rather than repeat the broad search.\",\n238:       \"contentHash\": \"92c156ff35b9\",\n239:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n240:     },\n241:     {\n242:       \"id\": \"ruled-out-3764ce9385b2\",\n243:       \"text\": \"Counting `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, or `tsconfig.json`: they are root JSON files but not among the eight named metadata types.\",\n244:       \"contentHash\": \"3764ce9385b2\",\n245:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n246:     },\n247:     {\n248:       \"id\": \"ruled-out-5e738fcda797\",\n249:       \"text\": \"Counting nested mode/packet JSON: excluded by the focus contract and direct-child glob.\",\n250:       \"contentHash\": \"5e738fcda797\",\n251:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n252:     },\n253:     {\n254:       \"id\": \"ruled-out-633679429a9c\",\n255:       \"text\": \"The similarly named root-name consumer-matrix test concerns catalog/playbook directory names, not this eight-file metadata census. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:80-138]\",\n256:       \"contentHash\": \"633679429a9c\",\n257:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n258:     },\n259:     {\n260:       \"id\": \"ruled-out-9cde60146902\",\n261:       \"text\": \"Treating `leaf-manifest.config.json` or `leaf-aliases.json` as generated because the manifest generator reads them: the implementation identifies them as authored inputs and only writes `leaf-manifest.json`. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:50-68] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:95-127] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:215-218]\",\n262:       \"contentHash\": \"9cde60146902\",\n263:       \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n264:     }\n265:   ],\n266:   \"rejectedPatterns\": [],\n267:   \"rejectedPatternIndex\": {\n268:     \"maxEntries\": 100,\n269:     \"fuzzyThreshold\": 0.85,\n270:     \"entries\": []\n271:   },\n272:   \"rejectedPatternWarnings\": [],\n273:   \"suppressedCandidates\": [],\n274:   \"minIdeaObservations\": 2,\n275:   \"observedIdeas\": [],\n276:   \"promotedIdeas\": [],\n277:   \"suppressedIdeas\": [],\n278:   \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n279:   \"graphConvergenceScore\": 0,\n280:   \"graphDecision\": null,\n281:   \"graphBlockers\": [],\n282:   \"divergence\": {\n283:     \"started\": [],\n284:     \"completed\": [],\n285:     \"failed\": [],\n286:     \"overrides\": [],\n287:     \"saturatedDirections\": [],\n288:     \"remainingFrontier\": [],\n289:     \"currentFocus\": \"\",\n290:     \"activePivotId\": null,\n291:     \"activeSourceIteration\": null\n292:   },\n293:   \"metrics\": {\n294:     \"iterationsCompleted\": 1,\n295:     \"openQuestions\": 4,\n296:     \"resolvedQuestions\": 1,\n297:     \"carriedForwardOpenQuestions\": 5,\n298:     \"keyFindings\": 5,\n299:     \"rejectedPatterns\": 0,\n300:     \"suppressedCandidates\": 0,\n301:     \"observedIdeas\": 0,\n302:     \"promotedIdeas\": 0,\n303:     \"suppressedIdeas\": 0,\n304:     \"convergenceScore\": 1,\n305:     \"coverageBySources\": {\n306:       \"code\": 11,\n307:       \"other\": 4\n308:     },\n309:     \"completedPivots\": 0,\n310:     \"failedPivots\": 0,\n311:     \"pivotOverrides\": 0\n312:   },\n313:   \"corruptionWarnings\": [],\n314:   \"inboxPath\": \"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/inbox.jsonl\",\n315:   \"inboxWarnings\": [],\n316:   \"status\": \"INITIALIZED\",\n317:   \"advisoryEvents\": []\n318: }\n\n(End of file - total 318 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"{\n  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-sol-high-fast-1785174758167-rdrppf\",\n  \"parentSessionId\": null,\n  \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n  \"generation\": 1,\n  \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n  \"terminalStop\": null,\n  \"keyQuestions\": [\n    {\n      \"