 consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\",\n      \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n      \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n      \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"resolvedAtIteration\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"question-3-what-consumer-derived-skill-class-taxonomy-maps-all-12-skills-and-makes-each-pre\",\n      \"inboxId\": null,\n      \"text\": \"What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\",\n      \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n      \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n      \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"resolvedAtIteration\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"question-4-how-should-the-five-graph-only-skills-leaf-aliases-json-command-metadata-json-an\",\n      \"inboxId\": null,\n      \"text\": \"How should the five graph-only skills, `leaf-aliases.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and sparse `sk-git` be classified after behavior-impact checks?\",\n      \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n      \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n      \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"resolvedAtIteration\": null\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"question-5-where-should-the-canonical-contract-live-in-sk-doc-create-skill-what-can-be-gene\",\n      \"inboxId\": null,\n      \"text\": \"Where should the canonical contract live in `sk-doc/create-skill`, what can be generated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it?\",\n      \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n      \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n      \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"resolvedAtIteration\": null\n    }\n  ],\n  \"resolvedQuestions\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"question-1-what-is-the-complete-12-skill-by-eight-file-root-level-census-and-who-produces-e\",\n      \"inboxId\": null,\n      \"text\": \"What is the complete 12-skill by eight-file root-level census, and who produces each file type?\",\n      \"origin\": \"legacy-import\",\n      \"source\": \"key-questions\",\n      \"injectedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"promotedQuestionId\": null,\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 0,\n      \"resolvedAtIteration\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"carriedForwardOpenQuestions\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What complete consumer and schema set governs each type?\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What behavior impact determines whether graph-only, alias, command, and sparse cases are required, optional, or defective?\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"What class taxonomy explains every presence difference?\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Which consumer or history evidence conclusively owns `command-metadata.json`?\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"Where should the canonical contract and fleet enforcement live?\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"source\": \"iteration-markdown\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"uncoveredQuestions\": [\n    \"What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\",\n    \"What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\",\n    \"How should the five graph-only skills, `leaf-aliases.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and sparse `sk-git` be classified after behavior-impact checks?\",\n    \"Where should the canonical contract live in `sk-doc/create-skill`, what can be generated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it?\"\n  ],\n  \"keyFindings\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"finding-1-5-command-metadata-json-is-a-singleton-confined-to-sk-design-its-two-entries-descr\",\n      \"text\": \"`command-metadata.json` is a singleton confined to `sk-design`; its two entries describe `/interface:design` and `/interface:design-reference`. No producer reference was found in `sk-doc/create-command` or `.opencode/commands`, so current evidence classifies it as hand-authored, not generated; this classification should remain provisional until consumer/schema research traces its ownership history. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-16] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:374-386] [INFERENCE: exact searches for `command-metadata` under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands` returned no matches]\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n        \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n        \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"finding-1-4-leaf-manifest-json-is-the-one-clearly-derived-artifact-generate-leaf-manifest-cj\",\n      \"text\": \"`leaf-manifest.json` is the one clearly derived artifact: `generate-leaf-manifest.cjs --write` builds it from `mode-registry.json` for hubs or from `leaf-manifest.config.json` for registry-less standalone skills, optionally incorporating authored `leaf-aliases.json` for hubs, and writes canonical bytes. The script explicitly calls aliases “authored,” while standalone config is an input declaration rather than generated output. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-19] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:50-68] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:95-127] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:173-218]\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n        \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n        \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"finding-1-2-fleet-totals-are-description-json-7-12-graph-metadata-json-12-12-leaf-manifest-j\",\n      \"text\": \"Fleet totals are: `description.json` 7/12, `graph-metadata.json` 12/12, `leaf-manifest.json` 11/12, `leaf-manifest.config.json` 4/12, `leaf-aliases.json` 5/12, `mode-registry.json` 7/12, `hub-router.json` 7/12, and `command-metadata.json` 1/12. Thus `graph-metadata.json` is the only universally present type; `sk-git` is the sole graph-only root. [INFERENCE: arithmetic over the exact matrix in Finding 1; the `sk-git` graph node is present at `.opencode/skills/sk-git/graph-metadata.json:1`]\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n        \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n        \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"finding-1-3-four-file-types-have-explicit-parent-hub-scaffold-producer-evidence-init-skill-p\",\n      \"text\": \"Four file types have explicit parent-hub scaffold producer evidence: `init_skill.py --kind parent` writes `mode-registry.json`, `hub-router.json`, `graph-metadata.json`, and `description.json` at the new hub root. These are scaffold outputs, though their checked-in values remain author-maintained after creation. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:528-553]\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n        \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n        \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"finding-1-1-the-exact-root-level-census-is-below-y-means-the-direct-child-file-exists-means-\",\n      \"text\": \"The exact root-level census is below. `Y` means the direct-child file exists; `—` means the exact direct-child glob returned no such file. Nested packet/mode metadata was excluded. [INFERENCE: exact direct-child inventory from `Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`, cross-checked against the 12 entries returned by reading `.opencode/skills/`]\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1,\n      \"sources\": [\n        \"`.opencode/skills/` direct directory inventory\",\n        \"`Glob .opencode/skills/*/*.json`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/init_skill.py:490-553`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:7-218`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:1-180`\",\n        \"`.opencode/skills/sk-design/command-metadata.json:1-574`\",\n        \"Exact `command-metadata` searches under `.opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-command` and `.opencode/commands`\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"ruledOutDirections\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruled-out-92c156ff35b9\",\n      \"text\": \"A broad `command-metadata.json` search produced oversized output; narrowing to the create-command and command trees found no producer. Future work should search its consumers and Git history rather than repeat the broad search.\",\n      \"contentHash\": \"92c156ff35b9\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruled-out-3764ce9385b2\",\n      \"text\": \"Counting `package.json`, `package-lock.json`, or `tsconfig.json`: they are root JSON files but not among the eight named metadata types.\",\n      \"contentHash\": \"3764ce9385b2\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruled-out-5e738fcda797\",\n      \"text\": \"Counting nested mode/packet JSON: excluded by the focus contract and direct-child glob.\",\n      \"contentHash\": \"5e738fcda797\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruled-out-633679429a9c\",\n      \"text\": \"The similarly named root-name consumer-matrix test concerns catalog/playbook directory names, not this eight-file metadata census. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/scripts/tests/test-root-name-consumer-matrix.cjs:80-138]\",\n      \"contentHash\": \"633679429a9c\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"ruled-out-9cde60146902\",\n      \"text\": \"Treating `leaf-manifest.config.json` or `leaf-aliases.json` as generated because the manifest generator reads them: the implementation identifies them as authored inputs and only writes `leaf-manifest.json`. [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:50-68] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:95-127] [SOURCE: .opencode/skills/sk-doc/create-skill/scripts/generate-leaf-manifest.cjs:215-218]\",\n      \"contentHash\": \"9cde60146902\",\n      \"addedAtIteration\": 1\n    }\n  ],\n  \"rejectedPatterns\": [],\n  \"rejectedPatternIndex\": {\n    \"maxEntries\": 100,\n    \"fuzzyThreshold\": 0.85,\n    \"entries\": []\n  },\n  \"rejectedPatternWarnings\": [],\n  \"suppressedCandidates\": [],\n  \"minIdeaObservations\": 2,\n  \"observedIdeas\": [],\n  \"promotedIdeas\": [],\n  \"suppressedIdeas\": [],\n  \"blockedStopHistory\": [],\n  \"graphConvergenceScore\": 0,\n  \"graphDecision\": null,\n  \"graphBlockers\": [],\n  \"divergence\": {\n    \"started\": [],\n    \"completed\": [],\n    \"failed\": [],\n    \"overrides\": [],\n    \"saturatedDirections\": [],\n    \"remainingFrontier\": [],\n    \"currentFocus\": \"\",\n    \"activePivotId\": null,\n    \"activeSourceIteration\": null\n  },\n  \"metrics\": {\n    \"iterationsCompleted\": 1,\n    \"openQuestions\": 4,\n    \"resolvedQuestions\": 1,\n    \"carriedForwardOpenQuestions\": 5,\n    \"keyFindings\": 5,\n    \"rejectedPatterns\": 0,\n    \"suppressedCandidates\": 0,\n    \"observedIdeas\": 0,\n    \"promotedIdeas\": 0,\n    \"suppressedIdeas\": 0,\n    \"convergenceScore\": 1,\n    \"coverageBySources\": {\n      \"code\": 11,\n      \"other\": 4\n    },\n    \"completedPivots\": 0,\n    \"failedPivots\": 0,\n    \"pivotOverrides\": 0\n  },\n  \"corruptionWarnings\": [],\n  \"inboxPath\": \"/Users/m