{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785175412532,"sessionID":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_Qlt0F6bxDSKeM4x9i0QNAZGG","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md","limit":500},"output":"<path>/Users/michelkerkmeester/MEGA/Development/Code_Environment/Public/.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/deep-research-dashboard.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: ---\n2: title: Deep Research Dashboard\n3: description: Auto-generated reducer view over the research packet.\n4: ---\n5: \n6: # Deep Research Dashboard - Session Overview\n7: \n8: Auto-generated from JSONL state log, iteration files, findings registry, and strategy state. Never manually edited.\n9: \n10: <!-- ANCHOR:overview -->\n11: ## 1. OVERVIEW\n12: \n13: Reducer-generated observability surface for the active research packet.\n14: \n15: <!-- /ANCHOR:overview -->\n16: <!-- ANCHOR:status -->\n17: ## 2. STATUS\n18: - Topic: Root-level skill metadata JSON contract for .opencode/skills/ across all 12 skills\n19: - Started: 2026-07-27T17:56:03Z\n20: - Status: INITIALIZED\n21: - Iteration: 1 of 10\n22: - Session ID: fanout-sol-high-fast-1785174758167-rdrppf\n23: - Parent Session: none\n24: - Lifecycle Mode: new\n25: - Generation: 1\n26: - continuedFromRun: none\n27: \n28: <!-- /ANCHOR:status -->\n29: <!-- ANCHOR:progress -->\n30: ## 3. PROGRESS\n31: \n32: | # | Focus | Track | Ratio | Findings | Status |\n33: |---|-------|-------|-------|----------|--------|\n34: | 1 | Build the exact 12-skill by eight-file root-level presence census and identify producer evidence for each file type. | metadata-census | 1.00 | 5 | complete |\n35: \n36: - iterationsCompleted: 1\n37: - keyFindings: 5\n38: - openQuestions: 4\n39: - resolvedQuestions: 1\n40: \n41: <!-- /ANCHOR:progress -->\n42: <!-- ANCHOR:questions -->\n43: ## 4. QUESTIONS\n44: - Answered: 1/5\n45: - [x] What is the complete 12-skill by eight-file root-level census, and who produces each file type?\n46: - [ ] What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests? [legacy-import]\n47: - [ ] What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective? [legacy-import]\n48: - [ ] How should the five graph-only skills, `leaf-aliases.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and sparse `sk-git` be classified after behavior-impact checks? [legacy-import]\n49: - [ ] Where should the canonical contract live in `sk-doc/create-skill`, what can be generated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it? [legacy-import]\n50: \n51: <!-- /ANCHOR:questions -->\n52: <!-- ANCHOR:uncovered-questions -->\n53: ## Uncovered Questions\n54: - Count: 4\n55: - [ ] What schema and complete consumer call-site set governs each file type, including advisor, benchmark, doctor, and tests?\n56: - [ ] What consumer-derived skill class taxonomy maps all 12 skills and makes each presence difference either required, optional by class, or defective?\n57: - [ ] How should the five graph-only skills, `leaf-aliases.json`, `command-metadata.json`, and sparse `sk-git` be classified after behavior-impact checks?\n58: - [ ] Where should the canonical contract live in `sk-doc/create-skill`, what can be generated/backfilled, and what fleet-wide presence-plus-freshness gate should enforce it?\n59: \n60: <!-- /ANCHOR:uncovered-questions -->\n61: <!-- ANCHOR:trend -->\n62: ## 5. TREND\n63: - newInfoRatio sparkline: ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄\n64: - score sparkline: ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄\n65: - Last 3 ratios: 1.00\n66: - Stuck count: 0\n67: - Guard violations: none reco