{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1785175711449,"sessionID":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_WQLMrVJ5R8Mt1YoP1BvVSEYf","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Trace hub metadata consumers","prompt":"Execute exactly one deep-research iteration using `.opencode/specs/sk-doc/019-skill-routing-refactor/021-skill-metadata-json-unification/research/lineages/sol-high-fast/prompts/iteration-002.md`. Read the rendered prompt and all state it names before research. Obey the packet-only write boundary and output contract, do not dispatch subagents, and verify all three required artifacts before returning the concise iteration report.","subagent_type":"deep-research","command":"/deep:research:auto"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_05b406f8fffeV3aH8m52aUydnR\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\n## Iteration 2 Complete\n\n**Focus**: Schemas and consumers for the four hub identity/router JSON files  \n**Findings**: 5 new findings  \n**newInfoRatio**: 1.00  \n**Questions answered**: Four-file subquestion; full eight-file question remains open  \n**Questions remaining**: 4  \n**Edge cases**: Partial success—broad searches overflowed; owner-scoped searches succeeded  \n**Recommended next focus**: Trace the remaining four metadata file types and `command-metadata.json` ownership.\n\n**Files written**:\n- `iterations/iteration-002.md`\n- `deep-research-state.jsonl` — exactly one iteration record appended\n- `deltas/iter-002.jsonl`\n\n**Verification**:\n- All three artifacts exist: yes\n- JSONL iteration append count: 1\n- Findings citations complete: yes\n- Packet boundary respected: yes\n- Reducer-owned files untouched: yes\n- No subagents dispatched: yes\n\n**Status**: complete\n</task_result>\n</task>","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","sessionId":"ses_05b406f8fffeV3aH8m52aUydnR","model":{"modelID":"gpt-5.6-sol-fast","providerID":"openai"},"truncated":false},"title":"Trace hub metadata consumers","time":{"start":1785175445861,"end":1785175711443}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_0b82df3f5e78ec5e016a679d9351688191a92be319d65b1ee8"}},"id":"prt_fa4bf877b001Ee4nVc7kI7fr5F","sessionID":"ses_05b4ae99bffebcntbfleru5bq2","messageID":"msg_fa4bf7719001Zz5IlBIVXVeerW"}}
